Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"When discussing weapons in science fiction, a plasma weapon is a type of raygun that fires a stream, bolt(s), pulse or toroid of plasma (i.e. very hot, very energetic excited matter).","title":"Plasma weapon"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" The primary damage mechanism of these fictional weapons is usually thermal transfer; it typically causes serious burns, and often immediate death of living creatures, and melts or evaporates other materials.","title":"Plasma weapon"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" In certain fiction, plasma weapons may also have a significant kinetic energy component, that is to say the ionized material is projected with sufficient momentum to cause some secondary impact damage in addition to causing high thermal damage.","title":"Plasma weapon"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" In some fictions, like Star Wars, plasma is highly effective against mechanical targets such as droids.","title":"Plasma weapon"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" The ionized gas disrupts their systems.","title":"Plasma weapon"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"A slapper detonator, also called exploding foil initiator (EFI), is a relatively recent kind of a detonator developed by Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory, US Patent No. 4,788,913.","title":"Slapper detonator"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is an improvement of the earlier exploding-bridgewire detonator; instead of directly coupling the shock wave from the exploding wire, the expanding plasma from an explosion of a metal foil drives another thin plastic or metal foil called a \"flyer\" or a \"slapper\" across a gap, and its high-velocity impact on the explosive (for example, PETN or hexanitrostilbene) then delivers the energy and shock needed to initiate a detonation.","title":"Slapper detonator"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" Normally all the slapper's kinetic energy is supplied only by the heating (and hence expansion) of the plasma (the former foil) by the current passing through it, though constructions with a \"back strap\" to further drive the plasma forward by magnetic field exist too.","title":"Slapper detonator"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" This assembly is quite efficient; up to 30% of the electrical energy can be converted to the slapper's kinetic energy.","title":"Slapper detonator"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Vacuolar-type H+ -ATPase (V-ATPase) is a highly conserved evolutionarily ancient enzyme with remarkably diverse functions in eukaryotic organisms.","title":"V-ATPase"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" V-ATPases acidify a wide array of intracellular organelles and pump protons across the plasma membranes of numerous cell types.","title":"V-ATPase"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" V-ATPases couple the energy of ATP hydrolysis to proton transport across intracellular and plasma membranes of eukaryotic cells.","title":"V-ATPase"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" It is generally seen as the polar opposite of ATP synthase because ATP synthase is a proton channel that uses the energy from a proton gradient to produce ATP.","title":"V-ATPase"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" V-ATPase however, is a proton pump that uses the energy from ATP hydrolysis to produce a proton gradient.","title":"V-ATPase"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"A plasma railgun is a linear accelerator which, like a projectile railgun, uses two long parallel electrodes to accelerate a \"sliding short\" armature.","title":"Plasma railgun"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" However, in a plasma railgun, the armature and ejected projectile consists of plasma, or hot, ionized, gas-like particles, instead of a solid slug of material.","title":"Plasma railgun"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" Scientific plasma railguns are typically operated in vacuum and not at air pressure.","title":"Plasma railgun"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" They are of value because they produce muzzle velocities of up to several hundreds of kilometers per second.","title":"Plasma railgun"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Because of this, these devices have applications in magnetic confinement fusion (MCF), magneto-inertial fusion (MIF), High Energy Density Physics research (HEDP), laboratory astrophysics, and as a plasma propulsion engine for spacecraft.","title":"Plasma railgun"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Plasma cells, also called plasma B cells, plasmocytes, plasmacytes, or effector B cells, are white blood cells that secrete large volumes of antibodies.","title":"Plasma cell"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" They are transported by the blood plasma and the lymphatic system.","title":"Plasma cell"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" Plasma cells originate in the bone marrow; B cells differentiate into plasma cells that produce antibody molecules closely modelled after the receptors of the precursor B cell.","title":"Plasma cell"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" Once released into the blood and lymph, these antibody molecules bind to the target antigen (foreign substance) and initiate its neutralization or destruction.","title":"Plasma cell"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Corona treatment (sometimes referred to as air plasma) is a surface modification technique that uses a low temperature corona discharge plasma to impart changes in the properties of a surface.","title":"Corona treatment"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" The corona plasma is generated by the application of high voltage to an electrode that has a sharp tip.","title":"Corona treatment"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" The plasma forms at the tip.","title":"Corona treatment"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" A linear array of electrodes is often used to create a curtain of corona plasma.","title":"Corona treatment"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Materials such as plastics, cloth, or paper may be passed through the corona plasma curtain in order to change the surface energy of the material.","title":"Corona treatment"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" All materials have an inherent surface energy.","title":"Corona treatment"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":6,"text":" Surface treatment systems are available for virtually any surface format including dimensional objects, sheets and roll goods that are handled in a web format.","title":"Corona treatment"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":7,"text":" Corona treatment is a widely used surface treatment method in the plastic film, extrusion, and converting industries.","title":"Corona treatment"}

