Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Meuse-Argonne Offensive, also known as the Maas-Argonne Offensive and the Battle of the Argonne Forest, was a major part of the final Allied offensive of World War I that stretched along the entire Western Front.","title":"Meuse-Argonne Offensive"}
