Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" They won their division for the 9th time and appeared in the Eastern Conference Finals for the 5th time.","title":"2011–12 Miami Heat season"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" For the second year in a row, Dwyane Wade, LeBron James, and Chris Bosh were all selected to the NBA All-Star Game, tying the record for the most Heat players in an All-Star game in franchise history.","title":"2011–12 Miami Heat season"}
