Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Reggie Miller and Dale Davis were both selected for the 2000 NBA All-Star Game in Oakland.","title":"1999–2000 Indiana Pacers season"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The 1998 NBA All-Star Game was the 48th edition of the North American National Basketball Association All-Star Game.","title":"1998 NBA All-Star Game"}
