Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Wertheim Performing Arts Center (also known by the abbreviation WPAC, full name The Herbert and Nicole Wertheim Performing Arts Center) is a performing arts center that opened in 1996.","title":"Wertheim Performing Arts Center"}
