Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is the first single released in support of their seventh album \"Dust\".","title":"All I Know (Screaming Trees song)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Screaming Trees was an American rock band formed in Ellensburg, Washington in 1985 by vocalist Mark Lanegan, guitarist Gary Lee Conner, bass player Van Conner and drummer Mark Pickerel.","title":"Screaming Trees"}
