Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Hands on In Between is a remix album from Paul van Dyk, released on 24 November 2008.","title":"Hands on in Between"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" This album consists of two CDs of remixed songs featured on the original \"In Between\" album in 2007.","title":"Hands on in Between"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" Selections from this album were remixed by various trance artists in the scene.","title":"Hands on in Between"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" It also includes the winning remix from van Dyk's \"Far Away Remix Competition\" featured on Beatport earlier in the year.","title":"Hands on in Between"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" The winning remix was promised a release, in which progressive trance producer Mateo Murphy was given the honour.","title":"Hands on in Between"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" As well as a release on the \"Far Away\" single, his remix made it onto this compilation too.","title":"Hands on in Between"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Seven Ways is a trance album by Paul van Dyk released on MFS in 1996 and later on Deviant Records and Mute Records.","title":"Seven Ways"}
