Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" Several editions include a bonus disc featuring remixes of tracks from the main disc, as well as bonus tracks.","title":"Seven Ways"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"In Between is the fifth studio album by Paul van Dyk released on 14 August 2007.","title":"In Between (Paul van Dyk album)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" The album features a wide range of collaborations including David Byrne of Talking Heads, Jessica Sutta of the Pussycat Dolls, Ashley Tomberlin of Luminary, Alex M.O.R.P.H., Lo-Fi Sugar, Rea Garvey of Reamonn, Ryan Merchant and Wayne Jackson.","title":"In Between (Paul van Dyk album)"}
