Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" Several editions include a bonus CD.","title":"Out There and Back"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"\"The Other Side\" is a single released on Paul van Dyk's second DJ mix album \"The Politics of Dancing 2\".","title":"The Other Side (Paul van Dyk song)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" Paul van Dyk wrote the song in retort to the devastating tsunami which hit southeast Asia on 26 December 2004.","title":"The Other Side (Paul van Dyk song)"}
