Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Forbidden Creatures: Inside the World of Animal Smuggling and Exotic Pets is a 2010 book by Doctor of Philosophy Peter Laufer.","title":"Forbidden Creatures"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is the second book in his untitled animal trilogy, following \"The Dangerous World of Butterflies\" in 2009 and preceding \"No Animals Were Harmed\" in 2011.","title":"Forbidden Creatures"}
