Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Sixth National Hockey League All-Star Game took place at the Detroit Olympia, home of the Detroit Red Wings, on October 5, 1952.","title":"6th National Hockey League All-Star Game"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" For the second year in a row, the format had the First and Second All-Star Teams, with additional players on each team, play each other.","title":"6th National Hockey League All-Star Game"}
