Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Abdul Qadir Khan (Urdu: ‎ , born 15 September 1955 in Lahore) is a former Pakistani international cricketer whose main role was as a leg spin bowler.","title":"Abdul Qadir (cricketer, born 1955)"}
