Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" There are 162 communes in Chile which have a street bearing his name, outnumbering \"Manuel Rodríguez\" (158), \"Gabriela Mistral\" (134) and \"Lautaro\" (116).","title":"Capitan Prat"}
