Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" He currently serves as the co-founder and CEO of WANdisco.","title":"David James Richards"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" His entrepreneurship is associated with the UK city of his birth Sheffield.","title":"David James Richards"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" In June 2012, he led the company to an IPO on the London Stock Exchange.","title":"David James Richards"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Jon Fisher (born January 19, 1972 in Stanford, California) is a Silicon Valley entrepreneur, investor, author, speaker, philanthropist and inventor.","title":"Jon Fisher"}
