Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" It has since become an annual event in early October at Auto Club Famoso Raceway outside Bakersfield.","title":"California Hot Rod Reunion"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" It has also spawned the National Hot Rod Reunion, held each year in Bowling Green KY.","title":"California Hot Rod Reunion"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Honorees are named at each year's reunion.","title":"California Hot Rod Reunion"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" The Honorees are pioneers in the sport of drag racing and hot rodding.","title":"California Hot Rod Reunion"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":6,"text":" The 25th annual event, presented by AAA and associate sponsor Good Vibrations Motorsports, will be held Oct 21-23, 2016.","title":"California Hot Rod Reunion"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Fender Hot Rod DeVille is a combo tube guitar amplifier manufactured and sold by Fender.","title":"Fender Hot Rod DeVille"}
