Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" The tour was named after the lead single from \"What About Now\".","title":"Because We Can (concert tour)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" All five major continents were visited during the 2013 tour.","title":"Because We Can (concert tour)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" The tour saw the band travel to Wales for the first time since their 2001 One Wild Night Tour and was also the first time since their 1995 These Days Tour that the band returned to Africa for two dates in South Africa.","title":"Because We Can (concert tour)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" Furthermore, this tour was the first time in the band's 30-year history that they visited Bulgaria and Poland.","title":"Because We Can (concert tour)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":6,"text":" The tour ranked 1st on Pollstar's annual \"Top 100 Mid Year Worldwide Tours\".","title":"Because We Can (concert tour)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":7,"text":" It earned $142.1 million from 60 shows.","title":"Because We Can (concert tour)"}
