Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Just a couple of weeks following his failure in Rio, Daniel competed at the Swedish Championships in Sollentuna.","title":"Daniel Ståhl"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" Not only did he win the discus throw on a new personal best 68.72 metres, it was also the new world leading throw of 2016, surpassing Christoph Harting's 68.37 metres from the Rio Olympics final.","title":"Daniel Ståhl"}
