Evidence: {"sentence_id":7,"text":" The day before, Daniel had also won the shot put on a new personal best 19.38 metres.","title":"Daniel Ståhl"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":8,"text":" In June 2017, Ståhl managed a throw of 71.29 metres in Sollentuna, setting a new personal best and improving the Swedish record set in 1984 by Rickard Bruch by three centimetres.","title":"Daniel Ståhl"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":9,"text":" Ståhl's throw was the farthest discus throw in the world for four years.","title":"Daniel Ståhl"}
