Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" Drawing upon his interest in both modernist literary movements and medieval architecture and pageantry, Winkfield has collaborated with many contemporary poets and writers, including John Ashbery, Harry Mathews, James Schuyler, and Ron Padgett.","title":"Trevor Winkfield"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Jack Shoemaker (born 1946) is an American editor and publisher, and current editorial director and vice-president at Counterpoint Press in Berkeley, California.","title":"Jack Shoemaker"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" Shoemaker has edited and published books under several imprints, including North Point, Pantheon Books, Shoemaker & Hoard, and Counterpoint.","title":"Jack Shoemaker"}
