Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" Shoemaker supports author-driven literary publishing ventures and mindfulness and political awareness in publishing.","title":"Jack Shoemaker"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Shoemaker was one of the first American publisher of Thich Nhat Hanh, and a major publisher of Wendell Berry.","title":"Jack Shoemaker"}
