Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Fictional accounts based on the events surrounding Harold Godwinson's brief reign as king of England have been published, notably the play \"Harold\", by Alfred, Lord Tennyson, in 1876; and the novel \"Last of the Saxon Kings\", by Edward Bulwer-Lytton, in 1848.","title":"Cultural depictions of Harold Godwinson"}
