Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Local elections were held in the United Kingdom in 1980.","title":"United Kingdom local elections, 1980"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" These were the first annual local elections for the new Conservative Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher.","title":"United Kingdom local elections, 1980"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" Though the Conservatives in government lost seats, the projected share of the vote was close: Labour Party 42%, Conservative Party 40%, Liberal Party 13%.","title":"United Kingdom local elections, 1980"}
