Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" In its final years it became known colloquially as \"Maggie's Militant Tendency\", in reference to then Prime Minister Margaret Thatcher and to Militant, an entryist group active in the Labour Party at the time.","title":"Federation of Conservative Students"}
