Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Pennsylvania and Ohio Canal, also known as the P & O Canal, the Cross Cut Canal and the Mahoning Canal was a shipping canal which operated from 1840 until 1877 (though the canal was completely abandoned by 1872).","title":"Pennsylvania and Ohio Canal"}
