Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"QNet Ltd, formerly known as QuestNet, GoldQuest, and QI Limited, is a Hong Kong-based multi-level marketing (MLM) company owned by the QI Group.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" The company sells a variety of products including energy, weight management, nutrition, personal care, home care, and fashion accessories etc. on an e-commerce platform.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" QNet was founded in Hong Kong by Vijay Eswaran in 1998 along with QN Europe and other companies.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" Since it was first introduced in 1998, Qnet (doing business at the time as Questnet) promoted gold and silver coins with an MLM system.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" But the coin collection business was touted as a money game and declared illegal in some countries.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" A few years later Questnet came up with a new name, Qnet and offered various other products via the MLM system.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":6,"text":" It promotes its products on its website using claims \"that would not pass official muster in much of the world.\"","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":7,"text":" Despite claiming to be an e-commerce based business, an ordinary retail customer can make a purchase of a product from the website only if they have a referrer ID of an independent representative of QNet.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":8,"text":" Unlike other e-commerce websites; purchases without this ID are not allowed.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":9,"text":" Qnet used websites/servers viz., www.qnetindia.in, www.qnetindia.net, www.qnet.net, www.questnet.net, to conduct its business which were blocked by Indian Computer emergency response team (CERT) following a court order.","title":"Qnet"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":10,"text":" Other websites like portal.qnetindia.net, are being investigated by the government and further action on the websites have been promised after details are gathered.","title":"Qnet"}
