Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" Soon afterward, he fled to the Democratic Republic of the Congo, where he spent three years in hiding.","title":"Juvénal Rugambarara"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" However, when the First Congo War erupted in the DRC in 1997, he then fled to Uganda, assumed a pseudonym and became a tobacco farmer.","title":"Juvénal Rugambarara"}
