Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Conestoga was a literary science fiction and fantasy convention held annually in Tulsa, Oklahoma from 1997 through 2010, after which it was suspended for financial and logistical reasons.","title":"Conestoga (convention)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" The convention at first was designated by the year in which it was held.","title":"Conestoga (convention)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" With its sixth incarnation, Conestoga converted to a whole number count, rolling the first five into the number tally, and running through #14 before stopping.","title":"Conestoga (convention)"}
