Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Transfer is a technique used in propaganda and advertising.","title":"Transfer (propaganda)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" Also known as association, this is a technique of projecting positive or negative qualities (praise or blame) of a person, entity, object, or value (an individual, group, organization, nation, patriotism, etc.) to another in order to make the second more acceptable or to discredit it.","title":"Transfer (propaganda)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" It evokes an emotional response, which stimulates the target to identify with recognized authorities.","title":"Transfer (propaganda)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" Often highly visual, this technique often utilizes symbols superimposed over other visual images.","title":"Transfer (propaganda)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" An example of common use of this technique in the United States is for the President to be filmed or photographed in front of the country's flag.","title":"Transfer (propaganda)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" Another technique used is celebrity endorsement.","title":"Transfer (propaganda)"}
