Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Rebecca Moore (born May 21, 1968 in New York City) is an American musician, actress and animal rights activist.","title":"Rebecca Moore (artist)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" Notable for her participation at a very young age in performance art and experimental theater productions()(), and for her own music, she is also known to some as a muse of the singer Jeff Buckley.","title":"Rebecca Moore (artist)"}
