Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Salman Humayun (Urdu: ‎ ) is a public policy expert with experience in managing, designing and delivering technical assistance and reform programs especially focusing on governance and education sectors in Pakistan.","title":"Salman Humayun"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" He is currently the executive director at Institute of Social and Policy Sciences and the co-editor of Journal of Social and Policy Sciences.","title":"Salman Humayun"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" He is also member board of advisors at Centre for Public Policy and Governance, Forman Christian College, Pakistan.","title":"Salman Humayun"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Scott Christian College is a college in Nagercoil, Tamil Nadu.","title":"Scott Christian College"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" It was established in 1809.","title":"Scott Christian College"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":2,"text":" It is one \"A\" College under NAAC ranking and is rated 5-star.","title":"Scott Christian College"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" It is also one of the nine colleges in Tamil nadu which were recognised by the central government as 'Institutes of Potential Research and Excellence' along with Madras University and Madurai Kamaraj University.","title":"Scott Christian College"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Scott Christian College is one of the earliest colleges in India along with Fort William College, Calcutta, started in 1800 which was closed in 1835, the Hindu College established in 1817 which was later named as Presidency University, Kolkata; the Serampore College in Serampore (Bengal) established in 1818 and the Bishop’s College, Calcutta(1820).","title":"Scott Christian College"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" It is the oldest college in the Erstwhile state of Travancore and Madras Presidency.","title":"Scott Christian College"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":6,"text":" Wikipedia says: \"The Maharaja had occasion to visit a school that was imparting instruction in English at Nagarcoil under the auspices of the London Missionary Society (LMS).","title":"Scott Christian College"}
