Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Mexican Indignados Movement (\"Movimiento por la Paz con Justicia y Dignidad\") is an ongoing protest movement that began on 28 March 2011 in response to the Mexican Drug War, government and corporate corruption, regressive economic policies, and growing economic inequality and poverty.","title":"Mexican Indignados Movement"}
