Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The 1990–98 Indonesian military operations in Aceh also known as Operation Red Net (Indonesian: \"Operasi Jaring Merah\" ) or \"Military Operation Area\" (Indonesian: \"Daerah Operasi Militer/DOM\" ) was launched in early 1990s until August 22, 1998, against the separatist movement of Free Aceh Movement (GAM) in Aceh.","title":"1990–98 Indonesian military operations in Aceh"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" During that period, the Indonesian army practised large-scale and systematic human rights abuses against the Acehnese.","title":"1990–98 Indonesian military operations in Aceh"}
