Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" It is estimated more than 300 women and children were raped and between 9.000 (9,000) and 12.000 (12,000) people, mostly civilians, were killed between 1989 and 1998 in the operation.","title":"1990–98 Indonesian military operations in Aceh"}
