Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"The statue of Sigmund Freud is a seated bronze statue of the founder of psychoanalysis, Sigmund Freud, situated on a limestone plinth at the junction of Fitzjohn's Avenue and Belsize Lane in Hampstead, North London.","title":"Statue of Sigmund Freud, Hampstead"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":1,"text":" Freud lived at nearby 20 Maresfield Gardens, for the last months of his life.","title":"Statue of Sigmund Freud, Hampstead"}
