Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" As of April 7, 2009 the paper ceased to be published as \"The Palo Alto Daily News\" and was consolidated with other San Francisco Peninsula \"Daily News\" titles; it published five days a week, Tuesday through Saturday.","title":"The Daily News (Palo Alto)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Weekday editions were delivered to selected homes.","title":"The Daily News (Palo Alto)"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" While continuing to publish daily online, \"The Daily News\" cut its print edition back to three days a week in 2013, and one day a week in 2015.","title":"The Daily News (Palo Alto)"}

