Evidence: {"sentence_id":3,"text":" On January 1, 2001, the United Kennel Club recognized the Russell Terrier as an official breed, designating only the stock from the American Russell Terrier Club as Foundation stock for the UKC Russell Terrier.","title":"American Russell Terrier Club"}
