Evidence: {"sentence_id":6,"text":" After appearing on \"The Tracey Ullman Show\" for three years, the Simpson family were moved to their own series on Fox, which debuted on December 17, 1989.","title":"Lisa Simpson"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"Ralph Wiggum is a recurring character on the animated series \"The Simpsons\", voiced by Nancy Cartwright.","title":"Ralph Wiggum"}
