Evidence: {"sentence_id":4,"text":" Graduate studies include the S.J. Quinney College of Law and the School of Medicine, Utah's only medical school.","title":"University of Utah"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":5,"text":" As of Fall 2015, there are 23,909 undergraduate students and 7,764 graduate students, for an enrollment total of 31,673.","title":"University of Utah"}
Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"John F. Weston (November 13, 1845 – August 3, 1917) was a Union Army officer in the American Civil War and a recipient of the United States military's highest decoration, the Medal of Honor, for his actions during a raid on Confederate shipping.","title":"John F. Weston"}
