Evidence: {"sentence_id":0,"text":"José Sisto, also called José Sisto Rodrigo and José Sixto, was twice Governor of Guam, first after overthrowing Francisco Martínez Portusach, and again after being legitimately placed in the position by the United States government.","title":"José Sisto"}
